<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Vineeth Reddy Nomula - Supply Chain Analyst. 3 years experience in SAP, Power BI, Procurement, Demand Planning. Open to work across US.">
<title>Vineeth Reddy Nomula</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:#fafafa;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:3px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#1a1a1a;border-radius:2px}

/* NAV */
nav{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:1000;
  padding:1.25rem 3rem;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  background:rgba(250,250,250,0.92);
  backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
}
.nav-logo{font-size:.88rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-decoration:none}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:2rem;list-style:none;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{font-size:.82rem;color:#666;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;transition:color .2s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#1a1a1a}
.nav-resume{
  padding:.5rem 1.25rem;
  background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;
  font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;
  text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.03em;
  transition:all .2s;border-radius:2px
}
.nav-resume:hover{background:#333;transform:translateY(-1px)}

/* OTW BANNER */
.otw{
  margin-top:64px;
  background:#f0fdf4;
  border-bottom:1px solid #bbf7d0;
  padding:.6rem;text-align:center;
  font-size:.78rem;color:#16a34a;font-weight:600;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem
}
.otw-dot{
  width:7px;height:7px;background:#16a34a;border-radius:50%;
  animation:blink 1.5s ease-in-out infinite
}
@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.2}}

/* HERO */
.hero{
  max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;
  padding:6rem 3rem 5rem;
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;
  gap:5rem;align-items:center
}
.hero-greeting{
  font-size:.88rem;color:#666;font-weight:500;
  margin-bottom:.75rem;letter-spacing:.02em
}
.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem);
  font-weight:800;line-height:1.05;
  letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:1.5rem;color:#1a1a1a
}
.hero h1 em{
  font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;
  font-style:italic;color:#2563eb
}
.hero-bio{
  font-size:1rem;color:#555;line-height:1.8;
  max-width:460px;margin-bottom:2.25rem
}
.hero-bio strong{color:#1a1a1a;font-weight:600}
.hero-btns{display:flex;gap:.85rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2.5rem}
.btn-main{
  padding:.85rem 2rem;
  background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;
  font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;
  text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.02em;
  transition:all .3s;border-radius:2px
}
.btn-main:hover{background:#2563eb;transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-outline{
  padding:.85rem 2rem;
  background:transparent;color:#1a1a1a;
  font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;
  text-decoration:none;
  border:1.5px solid #1a1a1a;
  transition:all .3s;border-radius:2px
}
.btn-outline:hover{border-color:#2563eb;color:#2563eb;transform:translateY(-2px)}
.hero-socials{display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:center}
.social-link{
  font-size:.8rem;color:#888;text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:500;transition:color .2s;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem
}
.social-link:hover{color:#1a1a1a}

/* PHOTO */
.photo-wrap{position:relative}
.photo-frame{
  width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/4;
  overflow:hidden;position:relative;
  background:#e5e7eb;
}
.photo-frame img{
  width:100%;height:100%;
  object-fit:cover;object-position:top;
  display:block;transition:transform .5s ease
}
.photo-frame:hover img{transform:scale(1.02)}
.photo-badge{
  position:absolute;bottom:-16px;left:24px;
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  padding:.75rem 1.25rem;
  box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.15rem
}
.badge-val{font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:800;color:#2563eb;line-height:1}
.badge-lbl{font-size:.7rem;color:#888;font-weight:500}

/* STATS */
.stats-bar{
  background:#fff;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  padding:0;
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)
}
.stat-tile{
  padding:2rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;
  border-right:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  transition:background .2s
}
.stat-tile:last-child{border-right:none}
.stat-tile:hover{background:#f8faff}
.stat-num{
  font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;
  line-height:1;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:-.02em
}
.stat-num span{color:#2563eb}
.stat-desc{font-size:.78rem;color:#888;line-height:1.5}

/* SECTIONS */
.section{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:5rem 3rem}
.section-tag{
  font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;
  letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;
  margin-bottom:.65rem
}
.section-title{
  font-size:clamp(2rem,3.5vw,2.75rem);font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:.65rem;color:#1a1a1a
}
.section-sub{font-size:.9rem;color:#888;line-height:1.65;max-width:450px;margin-bottom:3rem}
.divider{border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}

/* ABOUT */
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5rem;align-items:start}
.about-text p{font-size:.95rem;color:#555;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:1.25rem}
.about-text p strong{color:#1a1a1a;font-weight:600}
.about-facts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.85rem}
.fact{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;
  background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  transition:border-color .2s}
.fact:hover{border-color:#2563eb}
.fact-icon{font-size:1.1rem;width:36px;text-align:center}
.fact-text{font-size:.85rem;color:#555;line-height:1.5}
.fact-text strong{color:#1a1a1a;font-weight:600;display:block}

/* IMPACT */
.impact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.25rem}
.icard{
  background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  padding:1.75rem;transition:all .3s;cursor:default
}
.icard:hover{border-color:#2563eb;transform:translateY(-3px);
  box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(37,99,235,0.08)}
.icard-num{
  font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;color:#2563eb;
  line-height:1;margin-bottom:.5rem;letter-spacing:-.02em
}
.icard-desc{font-size:.85rem;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:.85rem}
.icard-co{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;color:#999;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}

/* SKILLS */
.skills-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1.25rem}
.sk{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);padding:1.6rem;transition:border-color .3s}
.sk:hover{border-color:#2563eb}
.sk-title{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;
  letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.sk-items{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.8rem}
.sk-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:.3rem}
.sk-name{font-size:.83rem;color:#333;font-weight:500}
.sk-pct{font-size:.75rem;color:#2563eb;font-weight:600}
.sk-bar{height:2px;background:#f0f0f0;border-radius:1px}
.sk-fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563eb,#7c3aed);border-radius:1px}

/* EXPERIENCE */
.exp-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem}
.exp-card{
  background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  padding:2rem;transition:all .3s;
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:2rem
}
.exp-card:hover{border-color:#2563eb;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(37,99,235,0.06)}
.exp-left{}
.exp-co{font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:.25rem}
.exp-period{font-size:.75rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.5rem}
.exp-loc{font-size:.75rem;color:#888}
.exp-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.35rem;margin-top:.85rem}
.exp-chip{padding:.2rem .55rem;background:#eff6ff;
  border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:.68rem;color:#2563eb;font-weight:500}
.exp-right{}
.exp-role{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;
  letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.75rem}
.exp-points{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem}
.exp-points li{font-size:.85rem;color:#555;line-height:1.6;
  padding-left:.9rem;position:relative}
.exp-points li::before{content:'→';position:absolute;left:0;color:#2563eb;font-size:.75rem}
.exp-points li strong{color:#1a1a1a;font-weight:600}

/* EDUCATION */
.edu-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.25rem;margin-bottom:3rem}
.edu-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  padding:1.75rem;transition:all .3s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.edu-card:hover{border-color:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(245,158,11,0.06)}
.edu-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#ef4444)}
.edu-icon{font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:.85rem}
.edu-deg{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:.3rem}
.edu-school{font-size:.85rem;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.2rem}
.edu-meta{font-size:.75rem;color:#888}

/* CERTS */
.cert-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:.85rem}
.cert{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  padding:1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.85rem;transition:all .3s}
.cert:hover{border-color:#16a34a;transform:translateX(3px)}
.cert-ico{font-size:1rem;width:32px;text-align:center}
.cert-name{font-size:.83rem;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:.15rem}
.cert-by{font-size:.72rem;color:#16a34a;font-weight:500}
.cert-badge{margin-left:auto;font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;
  padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;
  color:#16a34a;white-space:nowrap}
.cert-badge.ip{background:#fffbeb;border-color:#fde68a;color:#d97706}

/* PROJECT */
.proj-box{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);overflow:hidden}
.proj-header{
  padding:2.5rem;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#f5f3ff);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06)
}
.proj-tag{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;
  letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.65rem}
.proj-title{font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;
  margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#1a1a1a}
.proj-desc{font-size:.9rem;color:#666;line-height:1.75;max-width:580px}
.proj-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
.proj-left{padding:2rem;border-right:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06)}
.proj-right{padding:2rem}
.proj-sec{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;
  letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.proj-items{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.85rem}
.proj-item{display:flex;gap:.75rem}
.proj-dot{width:6px;height:6px;background:#2563eb;border-radius:50%;
  margin-top:.4rem;flex-shrink:0}
.proj-text{font-size:.85rem;color:#666;line-height:1.65}
.proj-text strong{color:#1a1a1a}
.proj-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.75rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.pm{background:#f8faff;border:1px solid #dbeafe;padding:1.1rem;text-align:center}
.pm-val{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;color:#2563eb;display:block;margin-bottom:.2rem}
.pm-lbl{font-size:.7rem;color:#888}
.tech-pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin-top:1rem}
.tp{padding:.25rem .65rem;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;
  font-size:.7rem;color:#7c3aed;font-weight:500}

/* CONTACT */
.contact-section{background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;padding:5rem 3rem;text-align:center}
.contact-inner{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto}
.contact-tag{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;color:#4ade80;
  letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1rem;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem}
.contact-title{font-size:clamp(2.25rem,4vw,3.25rem);font-weight:800;
  margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.contact-title em{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-style:italic;color:#2563eb}
.contact-sub{font-size:.92rem;color:#999;max-width:380px;
  margin:0 auto 2.5rem;line-height:1.7}
.contact-cards{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:.85rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2rem}
.cc{padding:.9rem 1.5rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;transition:all .3s}
.cc:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  transform:translateY(-2px)}
.cc-ico{font-size:.95rem}
.cc-lbl{font-size:.65rem;color:#888;font-weight:500;display:block}
.cc-val{font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600}
.roles{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1.5rem}
.role{padding:.35rem .9rem;background:rgba(37,99,235,0.15);
  border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.25);font-size:.78rem;color:#93c5fd}

/* FOOTER */
footer{padding:1.25rem 3rem;text-align:center;
  background:#111;font-size:.72rem;color:#555;border-top:1px solid #222}

/* ANIMATIONS */
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.fu{animation:fadeUp .65s ease forwards}
.d1{animation-delay:.1s;opacity:0}.d2{animation-delay:.2s;opacity:0}
.d3{animation-delay:.3s;opacity:0}.d4{animation-delay:.4s;opacity:0}
.d5{animation-delay:.5s;opacity:0}

/* RESPONSIVE */
@media(max-width:900px){
  nav{padding:1rem 1.5rem}.nav-links{display:none}
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3rem;padding:4rem 1.5rem 3rem}
  .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .impact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .skills-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .exp-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .edu-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .cert-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .proj-body{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .proj-left{border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06)}
  .section{padding:3.5rem 1.5rem}
  .stats-bar{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .contact-section{padding:3.5rem 1.5rem}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .impact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .proj-metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo">Vineeth Reddy Nomula</a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#impact">Impact</a></li>
    <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
    <li><a href="#education">Education</a></li>
    <li><a href="#project">Project</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a href="mailto:vineethreddy1981@gmail.com" class="nav-resume">Hire Me</a>
</nav>

<!-- OTW -->
<div class="otw">
  <span class="otw-dot"></span>
  Open to Work · Supply Chain Analyst · Procurement Analyst · Operations Analyst · All US Locations
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<div style="background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
<div class="hero">
  <div>
    <p class="hero-greeting fu d1">👋 Hello, I'm</p>
    <h1 class="fu d2">Vineeth<br><em>Reddy Nomula</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-bio fu d3">
      A <strong>Supply Chain Analyst</strong> with 3 years of experience turning messy data into decisions that reduce costs and keep operations running. From <strong>automotive floors in India</strong> to <strong>power systems in Texas</strong> — I build systems that actually work.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-btns fu d4">
      <a href="mailto:vineethreddy1981@gmail.com" class="btn-main">Get In Touch</a>
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/vineeth-nomula-b16a2b223" target="_blank" class="btn-outline">LinkedIn →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-socials fu d5">
      <a href="mailto:vineethreddy1981@gmail.com" class="social-link">✉ vineethreddy1981@gmail.com</a>
      <span style="color:#ccc">·</span>
      
      <span style="color:#ccc">·</span>
      <span class="social-link">📍 Alpharetta, GA</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="photo-wrap fu d3">
    <div class="photo-frame">
      <img 
        src="https://i.imgur.com/fpuqvAC.jpeg" 
        alt="Vineeth Reddy Nomula - Supply Chain Analyst"
        onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.style.background='linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#f5f3ff)';this.parentElement.innerHTML+='<div style=\'display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;font-size:5rem\'>👨‍💼</div>'"
      >
    </div>
    <div class="photo-badge">
      <span class="badge-val">96%</span>
      <span class="badge-lbl">OTIF Achieved</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- STATS -->
<div class="stats-bar">
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-num">$<span>120K</span></div>
    <div class="stat-desc">Freight cost savings through supplier analysis</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-num"><span>96</span>%</div>
    <div class="stat-desc">OTIF rate on $500K monthly freight spend</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-num"><span>87</span>%</div>
    <div class="stat-desc">Reporting time saved through automation</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-num">$<span>2M</span></div>
    <div class="stat-desc">Annual procurement spend managed</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<div class="section" id="about">
  <p class="section-tag">About Me</p>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text">
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">I turn supply chain complexity into clarity.</h2>
      <p>I grew up in India, built my supply chain foundation at <strong>Force Motors</strong> in Pune, and then came to the US to pursue my <strong>Master's in Business Analytics</strong> at the University of New Haven.</p>
      <p>At <strong>Cummins Inc.</strong> in Texas, I work at the intersection of data and operations — building dashboards that 12+ stakeholders rely on, auditing suppliers to find savings, and making sure freight moves on time every time.</p>
      <p>I'm now actively seeking my next opportunity — a role where I can apply both my <strong>operational experience</strong> and <strong>analytics skills</strong> to make a real impact from day one.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-facts">
      <div class="fact">
        <span class="fact-icon">🎓</span>
        <div class="fact-text">
          <strong>M.S. Business Analytics</strong>
          University of New Haven · 2025
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact">
        <span class="fact-icon">💼</span>
        <div class="fact-text">
          <strong>3 Years Experience</strong>
          Automotive & Power Systems Manufacturing
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact">
        <span class="fact-icon">🔧</span>
        <div class="fact-text">
          <strong>Core Tools</strong>
          SAP MM · Oracle ERP · Power BI · SQL · Excel VBA
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact">
        <span class="fact-icon">📍</span>
        <div class="fact-text">
          <strong>Based in Alpharetta, GA</strong>
          Open to all US locations & relocation
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact">
        <span class="fact-icon">✅</span>
        <div class="fact-text">
          <strong>Open to Work</strong>
          Full-time · Contract · Contract-to-hire
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="divider">

<!-- IMPACT -->
<div class="section" id="impact">
  <p class="section-tag">Proven Results</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Impact by the Numbers</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Every number here represents a real problem solved — not theory, not academic exercises.</p>
  <div class="impact-grid">
    <div class="icard">
      <div class="icard-num">$120K</div>
